{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather your flock for the most bird-brained battle in history! <strong>Chicken Chicken</strong> throws you and your friends into a post-apocalyptic world run by unhinged poultry, with one goal: total domination.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2922630/extras/f111ec1bb83f0e9078435ce2dde3f5bb.poster.avif?t=1762800269\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2922630/extras/f111ec1bb83f0e9078435ce2dde3f5bb.webm?t=1762800269\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2922630/extras/f111ec1bb83f0e9078435ce2dde3f5bb.mp4?t=1762800269\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With support for a massive <strong>2 to 16 players</strong>, this is the ultimate party game for huge gatherings. Jump into a rapid-fire series of madcap mini-games where you'll have to race, fight and sometimes just survive the sheer insanity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>WHAT MAKES THIS COOP CRAZY?</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>16-Player Madness:</strong> Experience the beautiful chaos that only comes from a screen filled with 16 desperate roosters.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A World of Feathers and Fury:</strong> Explore a vibrant, deranged wasteland packed with personality, junk, and very angry birds.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Endless Replayability:</strong> With a vast collection of mini-games and unpredictable players, every session tells a new story of betrayal and triumph.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's fast, feathery, and fantastically stupid fun. Are you the baddest bird in the badlands?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2922630/extras/f981326408a18fea9934a8804cfa3669.poster.avif?t=1762800269\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2922630/extras/f981326408a18fea9934a8804cfa3669.webm?t=1762800269\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2922630/extras/f981326408a18fea9934a8804cfa3669.mp4?t=1762800269\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2922630?t=1762800269","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2922630/4d132c578742fcdc3fd580bcfdbbf7df5b5835da/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1762800269","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2922630/be38eb441fffd91502ef2f03d0b4abcb85e57e05/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762800269","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2922630/be38eb441fffd91502ef2f03d0b4abcb85e57e05/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762800269","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"LAN PvP","id":47},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"LAN Co-op","id":48},{"description":"Cross-Platform Multiplayer","id":27},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_d